{"page":125,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:104","surah":5,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ تَعَالَوْا۟ إِلَىٰ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ وَإِلَى ٱلرَّسُولِ قَالُوا۟ حَسْبُنَا مَا وَجَدْنَا عَلَيْهِ ءَابَآءَنَآ ۚ أَوَلَوْ كَانَ ءَابَآؤُهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا يَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"when it is said to them, ‘Come to what God has sent down, and to the Messenger,’ they say, ‘What we inherited from our forefathers is good enough for us,’ even though their forefathers knew nothing and were not guided.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَعَالَوْا۟","en_gloss":"Come","transliteration":"taʿālaw","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"has (been) revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"and to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَسْبُنَا","en_gloss":"Sufficient for us","transliteration":"ḥasbunā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَجَدْنَا","en_gloss":"we found","transliteration":"wajadnā","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"upon it","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"5:104"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ءَابَآءَنَآ ۚ