 any of you, let two just men from among you act as witnesses to the making of a bequest, or two men from another people if you are journeying in the land when death approaches. Keep the two witnesses back after prayer, if you have any doubts, and make them both swear by God, ‘We will not sell our testimony for any price, even if a close relative is involved. We will not hide God’s testimony, for then we should be doing wrong.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شَهَـٰدَةُ","en_gloss":"(Take) testimony","transliteration":"shahādatu","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنِكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"baynikum","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَضَرَ","en_gloss":"approaches","transliteration":"ḥaḍara","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَحَدَكُمُ","en_gloss":"one of you","transliteration":"aḥadakumu","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتُ","en_gloss":"[the] death","transliteration":"l-mawtu","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حِينَ","en_gloss":"(at the) time (of making)","transliteration":"ḥīna","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْوَصِيَّةِ","en_gloss":"[the] a will","transliteration":"l-waṣiyati","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱثْنَانِ","en_gloss":"two","transliteration":"ith'nāni","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ذَوَا","en_gloss":"men","transliteration":"dhawā","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَدْلٍۢ","en_gloss":"just","transliteration":"ʿadlin","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"5:106"},{"pos":17,"ar