place. Let them swear by God, ‘Our testimony is truer than theirs. We have said nothing but the truth, for that would make us wrongdoers’:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عُثِرَ","en_gloss":"it is discovered","transliteration":"ʿuthira","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"(on)","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنَّهُمَا","en_gloss":"that the two","transliteration":"annahumā","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱسْتَحَقَّآ","en_gloss":"(were) guilty","transliteration":"is'taḥaqqā","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِثْمًۭا","en_gloss":"(of) sin","transliteration":"ith'man","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَـَٔاخَرَانِ","en_gloss":"then (let) two others","transliteration":"faākharāni","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَقُومَانِ","en_gloss":"stand","transliteration":"yaqūmāni","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَقَامَهُمَا","en_gloss":"(in) their place","transliteration":"maqāmahumā","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱسْتَحَقَّ","en_gloss":"have a lawful right","transliteration":"is'taḥaqqa","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"over them ","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْأَوْلَيَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"the former two ","transliteration":"l-awlayāni","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَيُقْسِمَانِ","en_gloss":"and let them both swear","transliteration":"fayuq'simāni","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"by Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَشَهَـٰدَتُنَآ","en_gloss":"Surely our testimony","transliteration":"lashahādatunā","verse_key":"5:107"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) truer","transliteration":"aḥaqqu","v